    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PixiEditor is a free and open-source universal 2D editor. Create clean pixel-perfect sprites, paint with raster tools, or design crisp vector graphics \u2014 all on one canvas. Animate frame-by-frame or use the powerful Node Graph to build fully non-destructive visuals and custom effects. <br><br>It features a <strong>clean, familiar interface</strong> inspired by popular graphic editors, making it incredibly easy to jump in and start creating.<br><br>Whether you're sketching, animating, or crafting a game-ready asset, PixiEditor gives you the tools to bring your ideas to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Toolsets for any scenario</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218560/extras/6bcaf2d905c85cfc894c38fd9cb22e93.poster.avif?t=1754304155\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218560/extras/6bcaf2d905c85cfc894c38fd9cb22e93.webm?t=1754304155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218560/extras/6bcaf2d905c85cfc894c38fd9cb22e93.mp4?t=1754304155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PixiEditor</strong> comes with three dedicated toolsets:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pixel Art</strong> \u2013 Tools tailored for clean, pixel-perfect editing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Painting</strong> \u2013 Soft brush, basic painting tools, and anti-aliased shapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vector</strong> \u2013 Paths and shapes for scalable, resolution-independent artwork</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All <strong>toolsets can be used on one canvas.\u00a0</strong>Export to PNG, JPG, SVG, GIF, MP4, and more! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Animations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create smooth frame-by-frame animations, or use nodes to animate custom shaders. Vector-based keyframe animation is also on our roadmap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218560/extras/ecec8297f85a8dd6f9b77cd0ce859613.avif?t=1754304155\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Node Graph</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Node Graph</strong> powers PixiEditor\u2019s most advanced features. Every effect, layer, and structure is built using nodes or node connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can customize every document non-destructively, combining pre-built effects and custom shaders to create stunning visuals and procedural art.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218560/extras/d15aaa1d5294703a65c89b03a8eb10b5.avif?t=1754304155\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PixiEditor is a free and open-source universal 2D editor. Create clean pixel-perfect sprites, paint with raster tools, or design crisp vector graphics \u2014 all on one canvas. Animate frame-by-frame or use the powerful Node Graph to build fully non-destructive visuals and custom effects. <br><br>It features a <strong>clean, familiar interface</strong> inspired by popular graphic editors, making it incredibly easy to jump in and start creating.<br><br>Whether you're sketching, animating, or crafting a game-ready asset, PixiEditor gives you the tools to bring your ideas to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Toolsets for any scenario</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218560/extras/6bcaf2d905c85cfc894c38fd9cb22e93.poster.avif?t=1754304155\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218560/extras/6bcaf2d905c85cfc894c38fd9cb22e93.webm?t=1754304155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218560/extras/6bcaf2d905c85cfc894c38fd9cb22e93.mp4?t=1754304155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PixiEditor</strong> comes with three dedicated toolsets:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pixel Art</strong> \u2013 Tools tailored for clean, pixel-perfect editing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Painting</strong> \u2013 Soft brush, basic painting tools, and anti-aliased shapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vector</strong> \u2013 Paths and shapes for scalable, resolution-independent artwork</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All <strong>toolsets can be used on one canvas.\u00a0</strong>Export to PNG, JPG, SVG, GIF, MP4, and more! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Animations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create smooth frame-by-frame animations, or use nodes to animate custom shaders. Vector-based keyframe animation is also on our roadmap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218560/extras/ecec8297f85a8dd6f9b77cd0ce859613.avif?t=1754304155\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Node Graph</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Node Graph</strong> powers PixiEditor\u2019s most advanced features. Every effect, layer, and structure is built using nodes or node connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can customize every document non-destructively, combining pre-built effects and custom shaders to create stunning visuals and procedural art.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218560/extras/d15aaa1d5294703a65c89b03a8eb10b5.avif?t=1754304155\" /></div></p>",
    "short_description": "PixiEditor is a universal 2D editor with tools and features for all your 2D needs. It blurs the line between vector and raster graphics. Create animations, procedural graphics, draw pixel-art, edit photos, vectors and more!",
